  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power to Youth - Rutgers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Power to You(th) is a five-year program from 2021 - 2025, the Power to You(th) programme (PTY) will empower adolescent girls and young women (AGYW) to increase their agency, claim their rights, address gender inequalities, challenge gender norms, and advocate for inclusive decision-making. As a result, harmful practices such as female genital mutilation/ cutting (FGM/C) and child marriage (CM), sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV), and unintended pregnancies will be decreased</narrative>
  </description>
